@startuml test_submit
title Student Submit Test

actor Student
boundary "TestTakePage" as UI
control "TestController" as Controller
control "TestService" as Service
control "ScoringFactory" as Factory
control "ScoringStrategy" as Strategy
entity "TestRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

Student -> UI: Nộp bài
UI -> Controller: POST /tests/{id}/submit

Controller -> Controller: Validate dữ liệu

alt Dữ liệu không hợp lệ
Controller --> UI: 422 Validation Error
UI --> Student: Hiển thị lỗi
else Hợp lệ


Controller -> Service: submitTest()

Service -> Repo: getAttempt(attemptId)
Repo -> DB: SELECT attempt
DB --> Repo: Attempt
Repo --> Service: Attempt

alt Attempt không hợp lệ
    Service --> Controller: Error
    Controller --> UI: 400 Bad Request
    UI --> Student: Thông báo lỗi
else Attempt hợp lệ

    loop Mỗi câu trả lời

        Service -> Factory: make(questionType)
        Factory --> Service: Strategy

        Service -> Strategy: calculateScore()
        Strategy --> Service: Score

        Service -> Repo: saveAnswer()
        Repo -> DB: INSERT answer
        DB --> Repo: OK

    end

    Service -> Repo: updateAttempt(score,status)
    Repo -> DB: UPDATE test_attempts
    DB --> Repo: OK

    Repo --> Service: Result

    Service -> Service: Dispatch TestSubmitted Event

    Service --> Controller: Submission Result

    Controller --> UI: 200 OK

    UI --> Student: Hiển thị kết quả

end


end

note right of Service
Factory Pattern:
Tạo Strategy phù hợp

Strategy Pattern:
Chấm điểm theo loại câu hỏi

Event Pattern:
Phát sự kiện sau khi nộp bài
end note

@enduml
